backrest (1.14.1+devass1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging for backrest, built from OBS scm-sync alone:
    - Upstream source is the backrest/ git submodule (garethgeorge/backrest
      at 148ba12, upstream main after v1.14.1).
    - Go modules, the Go toolchain (golang.org/toolchain) and restic come
      from build-gomodcache/, which OBS fetches from the top-level go.sum
      and checks against its h1: hashes. That go.sum is upstream's plus the
      toolchain and restic entries, generated by debian/update-go-sum.sh
      after verifying the go.dev tarball sha256 and restic's signed
      SHA256SUMS.
    - restic 0.19.1 is built from source as /usr/lib/backrest/restic.
    - webui-dist/ is committed, built by debian/update-webui.sh with pinned
      and checksummed Node and pnpm.
  * Never stop or restart the service on upgrade.
  * Create /var/lib/backrest, /var/cache/backrest and /etc/backrest with
    mode 0700.

 -- Pavel Artsishevsky <polter.rnd@gmail.com>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
